        "severity": "error",
        "description": "Assemble service dependencies with Layer.provide outside the operation's implementation. Effect.provide inside a reusable operation can acquire and release its layer on every call. Yield dependencies from the operation and provide its layer at application or test assembly. Per-test provision around an exported operation is valid. Keep Effect.provideService for dynamic contextual values.",
